tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515310/extras/ad7aad8f24457c4e6aa62673c6c49e24.webm?t=1734603931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515310/extras/ad7aad8f24457c4e6aa62673c6c49e24.mp4?t=1734603931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The wannabe murderer might not be a butler, but he's certainly in the audience. Navigate a labyrinth of tangled relationships and peel back the layers of deceit. The clock is ticking ominously, and every choice you make might decide the fate of your friends.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>- A noir aesthetic<br>- A detective-style murder mystery<br>- A unique setting (a Burlesque Club)<br>- Multiple endings depending on your choices<br>- An Incredible music track<br>- A charming telepathic dancer",
